@startuml Connix Frameworks and Drivers - Level 2
title Frameworks and Drivers - Level 2

package "Frameworks & Drivers" {
  [Composition root] as composition
  [TCP driver] as tcp
  [UDP driver] as udp
  [Unix Domain Socket driver] as uds
  [CLI runtime] as cli_runtime
  [Qt/QML runtime] as qt_runtime
  [JSON/YAML and file I/O] as file_io
  [Timer/concurrency runtime] as timer_runtime
}

composition --> cli_runtime
composition --> qt_runtime
composition --> tcp
composition --> udp
composition --> uds
composition --> file_io
composition --> timer_runtime

note right of composition
  Selects concrete implementations
  and keeps process in foreground.
end note
note right of tcp
  Stream transport
end note
note right of udp
  Datagram transport
end note
note right of uds
  Local IPC transport
end note
note right of timer_runtime
  Periodic events and concurrent
  DUAL legs
end note

@enduml
